SUMMARY:Schomberg Horticultural Society Annual Garden Tour
DESCRIPTION:The Schomberg Horticultural Society’s Annual Garden Tour showcases some of the most beautiful gardens and properties in and around Schomberg in breath-taking King Township.      This self guided\, self driving tour features around 8 gardens that are rarely open to the public and is in collaboration with Arts Society King\, the Schomberg Community Farm and the Township of King. Come and explore the beautiful vistas\, rolling hills and down-to-earth hospitality of King Township. Tickets (non-refundable) are available on June 1st on eventbrite.ca and on garden tour day at the Schomberg Library at 77 Main Street at 9:30 am. $ 15.00 pp\, rain or shine.
URL:https://gardenontario.org/event/schomberg-horticultural-society-annual-garden-tour/
LOCATION:Schomberg Library\, 77 Main Street\, Schomberg\, L0G1T0
CATEGORIES:Bus Tour,Community Event,District,Field Trip,Garden Tour,Partner Event,Society Meeting,Workshops
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://gardenontario.org/wp-content/uploads/2026-GARDEN-TOUR-FINAL.jpg
