SUMMARY:Garden Stratford Garden Tour 2026
DESCRIPTION:July Garden Tour\nJuly 5\, 2026\, 10 a.m. to 4 p.m. \n\nTour eight unique private Stratford-area gardens. \nTickets are available in advance starting June 5\, 2026 at:\n• Cozyn’s Garden Gallery\n• Klomp’s Home and Garden\n• Sebringville Garden Centre \nOn July 5\, tickets will be for sale only at Cozyn’s Garden Gallery\, 680 Huron St.\, Stratford\, from 10 a.m. to 1 p.m. \nTickets are $15: cash-only sales.
URL:https://gardenontario.org/event/garden-stratford-garden-tour-2026/
